codex
The log’s fatal error is in `first_path.py`: QBE rejects a newly added conversion fixture with “newline expected.” The mutable-width diagnostics are expected rejection results. The three new fixtures put instructions on one line, which LCB accepts but QBE rejects; QBE only sees them inside the Apple ARM64 native block. I’ll fix their formatting and move QBE compilation before the platform check so Linux exercises it too.
